---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';

// One general policy for every CfA program, so nobody has to maintain a
// per-program list here. A program page that states different terms wins.
// Registration checkboxes and welcome emails link to this page.
---

<Base title="Cancellation Policy | Center for Anthroposophy" current="/policies/cancellation">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Policies"
    title="Cancellation and refund policy"
    lede="This policy applies to every Center for Anthroposophy program unless the program's own page states different terms."
  />

  <div class="wrap policy-layout">
    <main class="policy-main">
      <h2>Cancelling a registration</h2>
      <p>
        Cancellation requests must be made in writing to
        <a href="mailto:office@centerforanthroposophy.org">office@centerforanthroposophy.org</a>.
        Requests received at least 30 days before a program begins receive a full refund, less
        a $75 cancellation fee.
      </p>
      <p>
        No refunds are given for requests received within 30 days of the program start date or
        once a program is in session. You may transfer your registration to a colleague at any
        time by emailing the office.
      </p>

      <h2>Payment plans</h2>
      <p>
        A payment plan is a commitment to the full program fee, paid in scheduled installments
        to the same card. The cancellation terms above apply to the full fee: cancel at least 30
        days before the program begins and we'll refund what you've paid less the $75 fee and
        cancel the remaining installments. After that, the remaining installments continue as
        scheduled.
      </p>
      <p>
        If an installment can't be collected, we'll email you to update your card. Access to
        the program pauses if a payment is more than 30 days late and resumes as soon as the
        plan is current. You can pay the remaining balance early at any time by contacting the
        office.
      </p>

      <h2>Single sessions and recordings</h2>
      <p>
        Single-session tickets and session bundles include the live session and its recording,
        so they aren't refundable. Before the session takes place you can transfer a ticket to
        another person by emailing the office.
      </p>

      <h2>If the Center cancels</h2>
      <p>
        If the Center for Anthroposophy cancels a program, you receive a full refund. If a single
        session within a series is cancelled and not rescheduled or replaced with a recording,
        you receive a refund of that session's share of your fee.
      </p>

      <p class="policy-contact">
        Questions: <a href="mailto:office@centerforanthroposophy.org">office@centerforanthroposophy.org</a> · <a href="tel:+16036542566">603-654-2566</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy-layout { padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
  .policy-main { max-width: 68ch; }
  .policy-main h2 { font-size: 26px; margin: 34px 0 12px; }
  .policy-main p { margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .policy-contact { color: var(--soft); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 34px; }
</style>
